# ============================================================================
# NOTES FOR DEVELOPMENT TEAM
# ============================================================================
# This .gitignore is designed for:
# - Utah Package Agency compliance requirements
# - Multi-system integration (DABS, SSCS, QuickBooks, Verifone)
# - Protection of sensitive pricing and inventory data
# - Professional development practices

# CRITICAL REMINDERS:
# 1. NEVER commit actual DABS Excel files
# 2. NEVER commit API credentials or OAuth tokens  
# 3. Use .env.example for sharing configuration templates
# 4. All sensitive data should use environment variables
# 5. Regular audit of ignored files for compliance
